LicoUp release fixture: placeholder for a compiled native converter entry.

This file stands in for the compiled executable a first-party package ships as
its native converter. It carries no interpreter: the package manifest declares a
process runtime with no runtimeRef, and the release tooling refuses an entry
whose name or bytes mark it as a script. Nothing in the repository executes it;
the fixture proves packaging, signed-index and offline-import behavior only.
